"More examples could be found in [test/test-serial-object.js](test/test-"
"serial-object.js)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/asynckit_README.md:211
msgid ""
"_Note: Since _object_ is an _unordered_ collection of properties, it may "
"produce unexpected results with sequential iterations. Whenever order of "
"the jobs' execution is important please use `serialOrdered` method._"
msgstr ""

